    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You\u2019ve been accused of unthinkable crimes \u2014 including destroying five entire star systems. But there\u2019s a catch: your memory has been wiped.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ethics Board is split. If you can\u2019t remember your crimes, are you still guilty?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their solution? A test. Prove you\u2019re not <i>innately</i> evil, and you\u2019ll go free. Fail... and it\u2019s curtains. Or lasers. Lethal ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guiding you through your psychological trials is <strong>the Director</strong> \u2014 a theatrical figure with a flair for manipulation, moral puzzles, and &quot;therapy&quot; sessions designed by people who definitely shouldn't have a license.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what if the only way to survive\u2026 is to break free from the script entirely?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings </strong>\u2014 Your choices actually matter.\u00a0Not just \u201ctwo buttons, same outcome\u201d matter - REAL consequences. Crazy, I know.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles Designed by Lunatics</strong> \u2014 Solve challenges like &quot;Guess the Emotion of This Fish&quot; and &quot;Can You Empathise with a Chair?&quot; Just standard stuff.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iconic Characters</strong> \u2014 A scam-artist banana with five fake identities. A ghost desperate to master jumpscares but tragically too adorable. You know, the classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Empathy Tests</strong> \u2014 Decide who to save from a sinking ship. Catch a falling puppy - or... don't. (But seriously. Do.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unhinged Minigames </strong>\u2014 Identify countries from cursed holiday photos. Guess historical years from bizarre images. Spot the anomaly before it spots you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind games</strong> \u2014<strong>\u00a0</strong>The Director <i>will</i>\u00a0lie to you. Frequently. Convincingly. Through song, maybe. Play along\u2026 or tear it all down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And finally...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728\ufe0f<i><strong>Escape the Script</strong></i>\u2728\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, I just dropped the title. That's how you know things are getting serious.</p>",
