years from bizarre images. Spot the anomaly before it spots you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind games</strong> \u2014<strong>\u00a0</strong>The Director <i>will</i>\u00a0lie to you. Frequently. Convincingly. Through song, maybe. Play along\u2026 or tear it all down.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And finally...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728\ufe0f<i><strong>Escape the Script</strong></i>\u2728\ufe0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, I just dropped the title. That's how you know things are getting serious.</p>",
